The main change I made is improving the error handling to properly log error messages. Instead of logging the error object directly (which shows as `{}`), I now extract the error message:

```typescript
const errorMessage = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);
console.error('EditProfileScreen: Error details:', errorMessage);
Alert.alert('Error', `Failed to add service: ${errorMessage}`);
