Replace `YOUR_TEAM_ID_HERE` with your actual Apple Developer Team ID (it's a 10-character alphanumeric string like `ABCD123456`).

## Alternative: Let EAS Auto-Detect

If you don't want to manually specify the Team ID, you can also:

1. Run `eas build:configure` again
2. When prompted, select your Apple Developer account
3. EAS will automatically detect and use the correct Team ID

